        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Focused Force"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Unlike most incorporeal creatures, a tumblak can make Strength-based checks against physical creatures and objects if it chooses, though such creatures still can't make Strength-based checks against the tumblak."
            },
            "id": "8e381130-5ff0-4330-ac72-dfc8cb8486e1",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:36.576062"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Claustrophobic Nightmares"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, divine, enchantment, mental)\n\nA creature fatigued by the tumblak's nightmare spell is subject to paralyzing glimpses of being buried alive. Anyone using an effect that would remove the fatigued condition through a means other than a full night's rest must succeed on a DC 44 counteract check or the fatigued condition isn't removed. When the fatigued creature enters a stressful situation, such as rolling initiative in combat or entering a high-stakes negotiation, it is affected by Entombing Echoes."
            },
            "id": "48b3626f-2670-4130-863f-6574d97766e8",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:36.576062"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Entombing Echoes"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, emotion, enchantment, incapacitation, mental)\n\nA creature struck by the tumblak's fist or impacted by Claustrophobic Nightmares must succeed on a DC 44 Will save or feel itself confined on all sides. The creature is immobilized and flat-footed until it Escapes (DC 44)."
            },
            "id": "7541774f-3a42-4ce1-a018-ae4e99e62c12",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:36.576062"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
